WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.260
Translation APIs such as DeepL,

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.268
Google Cloud Translation,

3
00:00:06.268 --> 00:00:09.727
OpenAI, and Claude fit
a pipeline you own.

4
00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:13.029
Translation management
systems such as Lokalise,

5
00:00:13.029 --> 00:00:16.779
Crowdin, and Phrase run
AI inside their editors.

6
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.588
General Translation manages context,

7
00:00:19.588 --> 00:00:22.792
consistency, review,
and delivery together.

8
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.833
With General Translation,

9
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:29.363
&lt;T&gt; sends JSX with its context,

10
00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:32.230
and a shared Glossary
keeps terms consistent.

11
00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.546
Reviewers edit in the Dashboard,

12
00:00:34.546 --> 00:00:39.781
and npx gt translate in CI
translates only what changed.

13
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.622
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
